  "takeaways": [
    "Pin risk can turn a defined-risk spread into undefined risk.",
    "Options can be exercised after the close, up to about 5:30 pm Eastern on expiration day.",
    "If the price is near a short strike, close the whole spread before the market closes."
  ],
